====================================================================================================
 NET-SIGN LANE: cluster-member EFE sigma-spread, per infall zone, real kernel + real orbit
====================================================================================================
  Z=sqrt(32pi/3)=5.7888   a0_can=9.360e-11  a0_alt=1.130e-10   member age=13.8 Gyr
  cluster M=1e+15 Msun, core 250 kpc; matched-field bin a_ex(now)=0.5 a0

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 (1) MG-IMPOSSIBLE piece is the sole theorem: d(sigma_MG)/d(history) = 0 at fixed a_ex(now)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   sympy: d/d(history) sigma_MG == 0  (any a0, any interpolation) -- MG has no history label.
   => the HISTORY spread at fixed a_ex(now) is MG-IMPOSSIBLE. This is the theorem-grade claim,
      untouched by the sign question below. The instantaneous theta(y_cur) boost is PARTLY
      SHARED (MG has an instantaneous EFE) -- that is the banked 6-13%, not the discriminant.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 (2) NET SIGN per infall zone, at MATCHED a_ex(now)=0.5 a0 -- felt spread via the REAL kernel
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

